Creating the plugin


Modify setup.py with a new entry_points argument to setup():

//add path to new mutator operators
setup(
    . . .
    entry_points={
        'cosmic_ray.operator_providers': [
            'example = example.provider:Provider'
        ]
    })



Now when Cosmic 
Ray queries the cosmic_ray.operator_providers entry point 
it will see your provider - and hence your operator - along with all of the others.


